      "text": "step-1 | creating frequency mapping of each element\n\nstep-2 | Now maintain a minHeap (which has less frequecy element at top) -\n         min freq element at top\n        \n         if minHeap.size() > k remove that element \n\nstep-3 | inside heap we have k element which has most frequnecy\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "step-1 | creating frequency mapping of each element\n\nstep-2 | Now maintain a minHeap (which has less frequecy element at top) -\n         min freq element at top\n        \n         if minHeap.size() > k remove that element \n\nstep-3 | inside heap we have k element which has most frequnecy\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
